## Tech stack

- **Frontend**: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, TypeScript 5, React 19.2
- **Style**: global.css, CSS Modules
- **Builder**: Vite
- **Test**: Jest, React Testing Library
- **Hosting**: GitHub Pages

## Project structure

Follow this layout when adding or changing code. When you change the structure, update this section and `.cursor/rules` if needed.

- `./src` - Source code
- `./src/components` - Shared app-level components and generic UI
- `./src/components/hooks` - Custom hooks
- `./src/styles` - styles
- `./src/tests` - tests
- `./src/assets` - assets

When modifying the directory structure, always update this section.
